Theme: The colour tokens in crates/ui/src/theme.rs follow the DAW theme of
SoundCraft (storytold/soundcraft, crates/ui-egui/src/theme.rs), licensed under
MIT OR Apache-2.0, with adjusted neutrals and StudioCraft's wine red accent.

App icon: assets/app-icon is original StudioCraft artwork (see its README).

Window frame: crates/ui uses craft-window from storytold/craft-libs (MIT OR
Apache-2.0) to decide per desktop whether StudioCraft draws its own title bar,
in which order the window buttons sit, and to make the bar move the window.
